WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:18.140
I'll join.

2
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:19.930
What?

3
00:00:19.931 --> 00:00:21.080
I just have to join, right?

4
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.620
I said I'll join the study group.

5
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.150
Really?

6
00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.730
What are you guys doing?

7
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.710
Um, Teacher...

8
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.560
Assault, and on top of that, arson.

9
00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.650
What is your name?

10
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.540
What? Me?

11
00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:20.670
Oh.

12
00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.939
Why did you come here?

13
00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:27.670
What if you get misunderstood too for hanging out with me?

14
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.630
No, just...

15
00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:35.470
- Because the study group leader got caught. - What?

16
00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:37.930
What leader?

17
00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.950
You're really an easy person to handle, aren't you?

18
00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.160
Ah, well...

19
00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:48.320
I found this while cleaning the classroom.

20
00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.070
Thank you.

21
00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:55.500
Oh, you're welcome.

22
00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:02.560
Me too.

23
00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.060
What?

24
00:02:04.061 --> 00:02:06.859
Not just yesterday in the practice room.

25
00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.250
But just now in the classroom too.

26
00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.220
Thank you.

27
00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.219
Thank you for what?

28
00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:16.609
Aren't we friends?

29
00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.659
I gave you gummies and vitamins.

30
00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:22.519
And waiting for you because you fell asleep in the library and I was worried you'd be late for class.

31
00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:24.030
There's absolutely no need to thank me.

32
00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:28.120
I never thanked you for that.

33
00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:33.430
Ah, ha.

34
00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:42.280
I told you to reflect on your actions, yet you're still giggling.

35
00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:45.540
I'm sorry.

36
00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.350
Bastard.

37
00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.659
Move, move, just keep walking forward.

38
00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:25.470
Move.

39
00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:57.449
Which school doesn't have problem students like this?

40
00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.829
Don't worry too much.

41
00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.929
Our school will quickly convene the School Violence Committee.

42
00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.380
And issue an expulsion.

43
00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:05.610
Expulsion?

44
00:04:05.611 --> 00:04:06.859
Vice Principal.

45
00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:09.239
If you do something wrong, you must accept the punishment.

46
00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.920
- But expulsion is a bit... - Stop arguing.

47
00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.609
Notify the student's parents and prepare for the School Violence Committee.

48
00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:16.670
Understood?

49
00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.370
Let's go to the practice building we didn't get to visit earlier.

50
00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.970
Isn't it this school that really did something wrong?

51
00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.189
Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

52
00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:46.930
Did I just hear that wrong?

53
00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:51.630
For this school, compared to 600 students,

54
00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.640
1 inspector is more important.

55
00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.110
Seriously...

56
00:04:57.111 --> 00:04:59.059
Living in this world, all sorts of things really do happen.

57
00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:02.939
If someone else saw this, they'd think I'm some huge villain.

58
00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.049
The bad one is that guy. That guy.

59
00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.719
The guy who uses violence in school like a delinquent.

60
00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:11.109
He only did that because someone else used violence and bullied people first, he had no choice.

61
00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.229
So because he suffered violence, he uses violence in return?

62
00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:17.689
- Violence is... - Violence cannot be justified. That saying is correct.

63
00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.039
But here,

64
00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.969
After observing Meteor Vocational High School for two days,

65
00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.640
I'm not so sure.

66
00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.540
If they don't use violence,

67
00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.819
a way for the kids to protect themselves...

68
00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.910
does it really exist?

69
00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:39.379
You're still the same, Ms. Lee Han-kyung.

70
00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:42.470
It turns out getting top place in the recruitment exam wasn't just luck.

71
00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:44.829
Passed at the top of the list?

72
00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.089
Right, I remember now.

73
00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:51.090
Last year's top scorer in the recruitment exam too, Lee Han-kyung.

74
00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:55.919
But for some unknown reason, she didn't accept the employment
and her passing status was canceled.

75
00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.759
Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

76
00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:58.770
Right?

77
00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.330
I want to become a teacher.

78
00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.250
One who brings a good influence to the kids.

79
00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.150
That kind of teacher.

80
00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.229
So, Teacher Lee Han-kyung,

81
00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:12.910
how do you want to fix the problems at this school?

82
00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:22.089
Even if you passed at the top, what can a rookie substitute teacher do?

83
00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.390
A study group.

84
00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.159
A study group?

85
00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.949
Yes, a study group.

86
00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:30.590
The study group was this student's idea.

87
00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.960
I want to work together to try and form a study group.

88
00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:36.780
Inspector.

89
00:06:36.781 --> 00:06:38.579
We don't need to continue this meaningless conversation.

90
00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.099
I think it's a great idea.

91
00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.429
A study group.

92
00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:42.600
Inspector.

93
00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.430
Vice Principal.

94
00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:48.279
A student says he wants to study, is there a problem with that?

95
00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:51.790
I just saw that the fire alarms weren't working properly
and cigarette butts on the ground...

96
00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.609
(3rd Period: English - Singular Form)

97
00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.180
(National Language. 3rd Period: English - Singular Form. Math.)

98
00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.119
(Those who want to study, gather around!)

99
00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.290
(Hwang Min-hyun)

100
00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.589
(Han Ji-eun)

101
00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:11.860
(Cha Woo-min)

102
00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:22.900
(Lee Jong-hyun)

103
00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:24.470
(Shin Soo-hyun)

104
00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.810
(Yoon Sang-jeong, Gong Do-yu)

105
00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:38.120
"Study Group"

106
00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.390
Jiamin.

107
00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.670
It's 34 minutes past.

108
00:07:58.820 --> 00:07:59.830
Thanks.

109
00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.569
(I can do it)

110
00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:12.700
Jiamin.

111
00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.460
Wake up, you have to go to school.

112
00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.290
Then let's study hard today too.

113
00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.170
Se-hyun.

114
00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.519
What the...

115
00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.070
This is the first time we've met here, right?

116
00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:54.370
Yeah, it is.

117
00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.450
You look terrible.

118
00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.630
Did you go to the hospital?

119
00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.350
Don't make a fuss about it.

120
00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.289
Why?

121
00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.920
We're in the same study group!

122
00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:06.600
Please.

123
00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.530
Be quiet.

124
00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.300
However,

125
00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:21.089
Did the inspector really approve it personally?

126
00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:21.950
Yeah.

127
00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.220
We are a study group recognized by the Ministry of Education.

128
00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.919
This shouldn't be hard for you, right?

129
00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.139
That's why you boasted so confidently.

130
00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:34.539
Yes, I can do it.

131
00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.550
Then try your best to do it.

132
00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:38.849
Once the study group gets messed up,

133
00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.650
your contract will end right then and there.

134
00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.360
Thank you, Vice Principal.

135
00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.340
I'm really curious.

136
00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:52.689
After you experience more at this school,

137
00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:57.960
will you still say naive things about a study group?

138
00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.619
Find 5 people within 2 weeks?

139
00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.990
Yes, only then can it be officially recognized as a club activity.

140
00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:06.920
It's a lost cause.

141
00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:08.260
Why?

142
00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.729
- Don't you have confidence? - No.

143
00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.809
It's just that finding not just 1,

144
00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.499
but 3 people willing to study in this school...

145
00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.390
Classmates.

146
00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.660
Isn't there a saying that goes like this?

147
00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.770
What was it... Napoleon's famous quote.

148
00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:24.199
'Today's misfortune is... of the time I wasted yesterday...'

149
00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.579
No, not that one. There's another one.

150
00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.379
'The best way to keep one's word is not to give it...'

151
00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:29.429
No...

152
00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:30.469
'Measure my height from the ground up...'

153
00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:31.430
I got it.

154
00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:34.600
'The word impossible is not in my dictionary.'

155
00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.570
I thought it was going to be something special.

156
00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.449
Yoon Jiamin. Kim Se-hyun.

157
00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.569
Don't you want to show the Vice Principal who has no faith in us

158
00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.669
what we're capable of?

159
00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:51.119
I mean, yes, I want to do that.

160
00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.289
But realistically, this is...

161
00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.340
We can do it.

162
00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.060
We can definitely find study group members.

163
00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:57.430
(Recruiting people who want to study)

164
00:10:57.431 --> 00:10:58.789
(Recruiting people who want to study)
- Study. - Study.

165
00:10:58.790 --> 00:10:59.710
(Recruiting people who want to study)
Study?

166
00:10:59.711 --> 00:11:01.299
Are they some new type of lunatics?

167
00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.569
F***, I'd rather smash my head than go to class.

168
00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:04.759
- Do you agree? - Agreed.

169
00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:05.820
Agreed.

170
00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.060
Se-hyun.

171
00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:13.820
What is it?

172
00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.070
We should be able to gather 5 people soon.

173
00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.130
Will it really be like that?

174
00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.219
However,

175
00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.329
what if more than 10 people sign up?

176
00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.749
Should it be first come, first served?

177
00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.149
Or,

178
00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.220
based on grades.

179
00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.630
If it's based on grades, you'd be the first to be eliminated.

180
00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:37.850
Let's go with first come, first served.

181
00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:47.379
Hello, I'm Yoon Jiamin, leader of the Meteor Vocational High School study group.

182
00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:49.030
Do you want to join the study group?

183
00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:52.009
May I ask what grade and class you're in?

184
00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.689
I'm Choo Ho-jin from Class 3-7.

185
00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.929
Class 3-7, Choo...

186
00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:59.069
I'm planning to confess to a girl from the neighboring school.

187
00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.500
But it's too embarrassing and I have nowhere to talk about it.

188
00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:04.270
So I wanted to ask if you guys could give me some advice.

189
00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.340
Our poster hasn't even been up for 3 hours.

190
00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:23.340
Are you Yoon Jiamin?

191
00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.110
I came after hearing the rumors.

192
00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:27.730
(1st Year Rank 3)

193
00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.250
It's too dangerous.

194
00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.429
Stop spouting nonsense.

195
00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.619
It's not like he ate some Devil Fruit.

196
00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.089
How could his feet catch fire?

197
00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:37.640
I'm telling you I really saw it. He's super strong.

198
00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.879
Lee Hyun-woo was swinging an iron pipe.

199
00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:43.149
That guy Yoon Jiamin breathed fire, and his feet were on fire too.

200
00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.109
Anyway, it was no f***ing joke.

201
00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.029
- You're going to die like this. - Get out of the way.

202
00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.249
The stench of that loser is drifting all the way over here. What the hell.

203
00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.239
Move over. Forget it.

204
00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.320
Damn it.

205
00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.660
Are you Yoon Jiamin?

206
00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.560
I came after hearing the rumors.

207
00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.580
Finally, someone came after hearing the rumors.

208
00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:09.970
Welcome.

209
00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.550
Wait a minute.

210
00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.080
Membership application form...

211
00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:19.330
- It was just here! - Damn it.

212
00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.700
Damn it.

213
00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.370
- Damn it. - I definitely had it!

214
00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:33.820
Wait a minute.

215
00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:47.550
Wow, his butt didn't even leave the seat!

216
00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.150
(Club Member Application Form)

217
00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.360
He's about to stand up.

218
00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.770
I'll go to the locker and get a new one.

219
00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:03.430
Damn it.

220
00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.209
- Did he pass out? - What's going on?

221
00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.019
Hey, did you see him smash his head on the locker?

222
00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.100
- That's hardcore! - What a psycho.

223
00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:20.600
Huh?

224
00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:23.350
Why is he...

225
00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:29.840
Nosebleed.

226
00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:35.779
Are you okay?

227
00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:36.909
Wake up!

228
00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:39.219
Wow, that guy is slapping an unconscious person.

229
00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:40.350
Isn't that going too far?

230
00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.669
The guy who defeated Lee Hyun-woo.

231
00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.639
He really is a massive demon.

232
00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:49.069
What's wrong? What happened now?

233
00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:50.229
Hey.

234
00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:51.489
He dragged the rank 3 guy

235
00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.789
to the library like a dog.

236
00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.999
Then beat the crap out of him using a "Mathematical Theorems" book.

237
00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.129
Took a potted plant and smashed it directly on his head.

238
00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.350
Then took a second potted plant.

239
00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:02.999
- I heard he was hospitalized. - Hospitalized?

240
00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.640
Hospitalized.

241
00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.189
But...

242
00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.560
Did our school actually have a library?

243
00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:15.070
That person from yesterday hasn't contacted you either, right?

244
00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:18.910
He doesn't seem to have come to school today.

245
00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.260
To think the first person to sign up suddenly got sick.

246
00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:24.629
What a shame.

247
00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:27.270
No, he wasn't here to sign up at all.

248
00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.549
- What? - Looks like we need to change our method.

249
00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:38.420
Change how?

250
00:15:38.421 --> 00:15:40.930
If waiting for people doesn't work, then we go find them directly.

251
00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:42.390
Find what?

252
00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:46.790
The look of wanting to study.

253
00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.579
What I'm curious about is,

254
00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:50.859
why didn't that guy beat him up on the roof,

255
00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:52.589
but chose the library instead?

256
00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.400
Shouldn't the classic scene be on the roof?

257
00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.429
Because the library is huge and sound echoes there!

258
00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.380
Right?

259
00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.609
Psycho, so what?

260
00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.899
You clueless idiot.

261
00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.280
There's no communicating with you.

262
00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.879
He wanted to use stereo surround sound

263
00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:11.410
to enjoy the sound of the other guy's painful moans!

264
00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.259
What an absolutely crazy bastard.

265
00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:17.259
- Total psycho. - Do you get it now?

266
00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.110
Seriously.

267
00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:19.920
Hey...

268
00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:25.370
Ramen...

269
00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.499
Guys with clear eyes like that are the true maniacs.

270
00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:31.569
What kind of people is he looking for to start some study group?

271
00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:32.669
Damn it.

272
00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:33.919
He's definitely grabbing those who want to study, right?

273
00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.009
It is a study group, after all.

274
00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.859
F***, who in our school wants to study?

275
00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:38.879
- Exactly, you bastard! - What, you son of a bitch?

276
00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.179
He must be looking for a group of people who absolutely don't want to study,

277
00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.759
and then forces them to study.

278
00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.940
Only then is it painful!

279
00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:45.569
People who absolutely don't want to study?

280
00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:47.019
- Makes sense. - You get it, right?

281
00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:47.620
F***, I'm doomed.

282
00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:48.510
I need to keep a low profile.

283
00:16:48.511 --> 00:16:50.049
- Why are you dressed like a sick chicken? - Crazy.

284
00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:51.530
Shut up, you bastard.

285
00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:54.520
Huh?

286
00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.630
Let's go.

287
00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:27.910
Nothing.

288
00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.249
Holy s***.

289
00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.939
Crazy bastard.

290
00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.259
You almost had it bad.

291
00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.610
That's crazy. Are you okay?

292
00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.999
That was a look pleading for help, right?

293
00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.659
He looked like he was in extreme pain, right?

294
00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.490
- Exactly! - F***.

295
00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.780
I was almost dragged into the study group like that guy.

296
00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:18.330
So weird.

297
00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:21.349
Isn't this expected?

298
00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.450
I told you this school doesn't have the kind of good students you're looking for.

299
00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:28.260
It's not like that.

300
00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:32.060
There are no students around at all.

301
00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.100
Oh, Park Geon-yeop.

302
00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.229
Do you know him?

303
00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:48.470
Yeah, he's my middle school classmate.

304
00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:50.669
But he went to study abroad in the US in eighth grade.

305
00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:51.840
When did he come back?

306
00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:53.580
Studied abroad in the US?

307
00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:57.359
Hey... you better not mess with him.

308
00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.480
Damn it.

309
00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:05.469
I heard you came back from the US.

310
00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:06.950
Your English must be really good, right?

311
00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.559
Do you want to join our study group?

312
00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.680
A study group?

313
00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.000
Yes.

314
00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.900
You seem very confident.

315
00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.860
Or maybe,

316
00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:22.400
you don't care much about the people around you getting hurt?

317
00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:35.150
Good job.

318
00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.040
See you tomorrow.

319
00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:50.790
The number you dialed is not answering.
You will be transferred to voicemail after the beep.

320
00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:54.340
(Class 1-4 Lee Hyun-woo)

321
00:19:57.180 --> 00:20:00.780
(Name: Lee Hyun-woo
Address: 45 Namseokdong-ro 12-gil, Eonseo-gu, Ancheon)

322
00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.010
(A gift for Vita Study VIP member Yoon Jiamin
50% discount coupon for online courses!)

323
00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:35.340
Do you absolutely have to form a study group?

324
00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.079
You might as well go to a cram school.

325
00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.669
Daechi-dong, Mok-dong, Noryangjin.

326
00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:41.819
I've been to all of them.

327
00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:43.600
Aren't there online courses too?

328
00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:47.129
Jung Seung-je, Choi Chi-yeol, Jeon Jong-yeol...

329
00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:48.240
I know.

330
00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:50.480
Sorry.

331
00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:54.479
However,

332
00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:55.989
honestly, with a physique like yours,

333
00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:58.339
wouldn't it be better to pursue sports instead of studying?

334
00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.350
Sports?

335
00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:02.969
I exercise only to build the physical stamina needed for studying.

336
00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:04.049
Right, even if that was your starting point,

337
00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:07.570
if you have exceptional talent in that area
you could always switch paths.

338
00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:11.390
But I still like studying more.

339
00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:21.319
What the...

340
00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.130
Are you too disappointed?

341
00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.810
Not a single person signed up.

342
00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.290
Let's go outside.

343
00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:31.440
What?

344
00:21:31.441 --> 00:21:33.829
Sometimes you need a change of pace.

345
00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:34.670
Let's go.

346
00:21:41.470 --> 00:21:42.540
Oh, Jiamin.

347
00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:44.200
How about this one?

348
00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:45.879
I already have this book at home.

349
00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:46.980
- Really? - Yes.

350
00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:48.760
How about this one?

351
00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:50.300
I have this one too.

352
00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:51.240
Jiamin, this one...

353
00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:02.530
Se-hyun, what do you think of this one?

354
00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.429
Anything is fine with me.

355
00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:05.470
Wow.

356
00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:07.170
What are you doing there?

357
00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:09.940
Oh.

358
00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:12.720
Nothing, not doing anything.

359
00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.360
- Thank you. - Thank you, we will enjoy it.

360
00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:18.780
- Let's eat. - I'm digging in.

361
00:22:20.930 --> 00:22:22.319
So delicious.

362
00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:23.220
Delicious.

363
00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:26.509
Teacher, can I choose three flavors?

364
00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:29.359
Yeah, it must be delicious. Pick what you want.

365
00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:31.649
Have there always been this many flavors?

366
00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:34.650
Then I'll have mochi and chocolate...

367
00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:42.130
By the way,

368
00:22:42.520 --> 00:22:44.549
But Jiamin, I'm curious.

369
00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:47.790
Why did you buy so many ballpoint pens?

370
00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:57.290
This pen writes curves smoothly
so I use it for math problems with lots of numbers.

371
00:22:58.380 --> 00:23:00.210
This pen doesn't skip ink, so I use it to take notes on what the teacher says.

372
00:23:00.740 --> 00:23:02.869
And this blue pen helps promote serotonin secretion,
which activates the brain and improves memory.

373
00:23:02.870 --> 00:23:03.919
Also,

374
00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:05.199
this one is a new product.

375
00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:07.510
Because it has a stable grip, I plan to try it out.

376
00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:12.460
Are you a ballpoint pen doctor?

377
00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:15.789
What pen do you use?

378
00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:16.600
Me?

379
00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:23.670
I just use the 300-won national ballpoint pen.

380
00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:28.309
So the secret lies here!

381
00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:32.730
Just like block letters full of sincerity, staying true to the basics.

382
00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:35.010
I should have bought one too.

383
00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:38.780
What a shame.

384
00:23:41.660 --> 00:23:42.760
By the way,

385
00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:45.009
Teacher, you passed the recruitment exam at the top,

386
00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:46.560
why did you come to Meteor Vocational High School?

387
00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:50.110
Yeah, you could have gone to a better place.

388
00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:57.070
That's because...

389
00:23:59.190 --> 00:24:02.289
At that time, I was a bit overwhelmed, too many things going on.

390
00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:05.810
So I forgot to fill out my preferences.

391
00:24:07.060 --> 00:24:08.249
So cool.

392
00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:09.510
Yeah, super cool.

393
00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:13.519
Anyway, we've refreshed our mood today.

394
00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:15.109
So don't give up on the study group.

395
00:24:15.110 --> 00:24:16.530
Let's push a little harder and try.

396
00:24:17.210 --> 00:24:18.269
Okay.

397
00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:19.320
Cheer up!

398
00:24:20.180 --> 00:24:21.330
- Let's go! - Let's go!

399
00:24:31.540 --> 00:24:32.900
Why is this here?

400
00:24:35.990 --> 00:24:36.800
What's wrong?

401
00:24:38.050 --> 00:24:38.940
It's missing.

402
00:24:40.110 --> 00:24:41.010
What thing?

403
00:24:42.680 --> 00:24:44.670
I think I put my book into the teacher's bag.

404
00:24:45.090 --> 00:24:46.980
Then you can just get it from her tomorrow.

405
00:24:52.430 --> 00:24:54.540
What's wrong? What book is it?

406
00:24:55.670 --> 00:24:57.330
Don't you have a curfew?

407
00:24:57.830 --> 00:24:58.730
Yeah.

408
00:25:09.110 --> 00:25:10.040
Found it.

409
00:25:10.041 --> 00:25:12.430
(Class 1-4 Yoon Jiamin)

410
00:25:41.950 --> 00:25:43.180
Teacher, you're back.

411
00:25:44.880 --> 00:25:45.980
Hyun-woo.

412
00:25:57.740 --> 00:25:59.140
(Missed Call: Teacher Lee Han-kyung)

413
00:26:04.710 --> 00:26:05.690
Hyun-woo.

414
00:26:06.740 --> 00:26:08.389
What are you doing?

415
00:26:08.390 --> 00:26:10.260
We want to join the study group too.

416
00:26:12.010 --> 00:26:13.690
Didn't you say we could come to you anytime?

417
00:26:14.700 --> 00:26:16.570
I don't think this is what I meant.

418
00:26:18.690 --> 00:26:19.879
Is that so?

419
00:26:19.880 --> 00:26:20.780
I don't want to...

420
00:26:22.390 --> 00:26:24.739
call the police on you. Go back.

421
00:26:24.740 --> 00:26:26.319
Let's talk at school tomorrow.

422
00:26:26.320 --> 00:26:27.760
But Teacher.

423
00:26:31.610 --> 00:26:33.599
If I just leave like this today, I'm dead meat.

424
00:26:33.600 --> 00:26:34.690
Hyun-woo.

425
00:26:36.020 --> 00:26:38.889
Teacher is getting a little angry right now.

426
00:26:38.890 --> 00:26:40.090
- So... - Teacher.

427
00:26:41.380 --> 00:26:43.710
You've only been at the school for a few days, right?

428
00:26:44.660 --> 00:26:47.799
Just what did you do to get targeted so quickly?

429
00:26:47.800 --> 00:26:49.379
I'm targeted?

430
00:26:49.380 --> 00:26:51.060
Who else could it be?

431
00:26:54.150 --> 00:26:55.240
No way.

432
00:26:56.030 --> 00:26:57.689
So you really didn't know.

433
00:26:57.690 --> 00:26:59.470
What don't I know?

434
00:27:01.200 --> 00:27:02.509
Han-wool bro.

435
00:27:02.510 --> 00:27:03.250
Han-wool bro?

436
00:27:03.251 --> 00:27:05.930
Han-wool bro said he's going to make it so you can't be a teacher.

437
00:27:06.460 --> 00:27:08.480
But I don't know what to do.

438
00:27:09.440 --> 00:27:10.850
Could you teach me?

439
00:27:21.260 --> 00:27:22.490
(Class 1-4 Yoon Jiamin)

440
00:27:23.800 --> 00:27:24.829
Damn it.

441
00:27:24.830 --> 00:27:26.439
The number you dialed is not responding.

442
00:27:26.440 --> 00:27:30.720
You will be transferred to voicemail. Charges apply after the beep.

443
00:27:55.040 --> 00:27:55.990
Teacher.

444
00:27:57.550 --> 00:27:59.079
Do you know why people

445
00:27:59.080 --> 00:28:00.590
still feel scared even knowing the police exist?

446
00:28:01.650 --> 00:28:03.030
Because the police

447
00:28:03.520 --> 00:28:05.310
always show up only after everything is over.

448
00:28:07.770 --> 00:28:09.510
Damn it, what's going on? Who turned the lights...

449
00:28:11.610 --> 00:28:12.690
Who is it? F***.

450
00:28:13.540 --> 00:28:14.970
Hey, f***.

451
00:28:26.490 --> 00:28:27.720
Bastard.

452
00:28:30.760 --> 00:28:31.650
Damn it.

453
00:28:58.910 --> 00:29:00.680
You're the one who carried the oil drums that day, right?

454
00:29:01.320 --> 00:29:02.240
Geon-yeop.

455
00:29:07.190 --> 00:29:08.930
How did you know I was here?

456
00:29:10.920 --> 00:29:11.870
They're here, f***.

457
00:29:22.710 --> 00:29:23.210
(Exit)

458
00:29:54.770 --> 00:29:55.959
Student.

459
00:29:55.960 --> 00:29:56.830
Lend me your phone.

460
00:30:04.700 --> 00:30:05.650
Found it.

461
00:30:14.960 --> 00:30:17.130
Listen to me, kids.

462
00:30:17.590 --> 00:30:19.029
You guys calm down first.

463
00:30:19.030 --> 00:30:20.600
Don't make things any more...

464
00:30:25.040 --> 00:30:26.410
Teacher, I'm sorry.

465
00:30:27.010 --> 00:30:28.870
I should have told you earlier.

466
00:30:29.470 --> 00:30:31.199
This guy not only hits teachers, but also women.

467
00:30:31.200 --> 00:30:32.660
He's an absurd bastard.

468
00:30:38.400 --> 00:30:39.250
Bring it on.

469
00:30:40.220 --> 00:30:41.250
But you'll have to risk your lives.

470
00:30:49.260 --> 00:30:50.970
(Class 1-4 Yoon Jiamin)

471
00:30:54.480 --> 00:30:55.740
Hey, they said they caught someone.

472
00:31:06.360 --> 00:31:07.560
What's up with that kid?

473
00:31:09.680 --> 00:31:11.380
I think I've seen him somewhere before.

474
00:31:29.590 --> 00:31:30.640
I remember now.

475
00:31:31.190 --> 00:31:32.330
That kid.

476
00:31:32.750 --> 00:31:34.820
You're Park Geon-yeop from Sejong Middle School, right?

477
00:31:35.530 --> 00:31:36.490
Do you know him?

478
00:31:37.310 --> 00:31:38.230
You should know too.

479
00:31:38.231 --> 00:31:39.669
Wasn't it a big deal in the news back then?

480
00:31:39.670 --> 00:31:40.970
Was it during our middle school days?

481
00:31:41.550 --> 00:31:43.230
Did you forget about the random stabbing incident?

482
00:31:45.020 --> 00:31:45.960
F***.

483
00:31:45.961 --> 00:31:47.059
Damn it, scared me.

484
00:31:47.060 --> 00:31:48.189
Seeing this guy take a punch to the left abdomen

485
00:31:48.190 --> 00:31:50.169
and looking like he was in deadly pain, I recognized him.

486
00:31:50.170 --> 00:31:51.090
A scar.

487
00:31:51.460 --> 00:31:52.810
It's a knife scar!

488
00:31:56.730 --> 00:31:58.190
- You punk. - Kick him.

489
00:32:06.560 --> 00:32:08.110
Stop hitting him.

490
00:32:21.640 --> 00:32:22.780
What's going on, damn it.

491
00:32:25.670 --> 00:32:27.579
Teacher, are you okay?

492
00:32:27.580 --> 00:32:28.600
Aren't you going to let go?

493
00:32:31.720 --> 00:32:32.920
Hey, don't be scared.

494
00:32:33.290 --> 00:32:34.930
If we all attack together, what can he do...

495
00:32:52.100 --> 00:32:53.300
Hey, you punk.

496
00:32:58.430 --> 00:32:59.640
You bastard.

497
00:33:04.020 --> 00:33:04.950
Go to hell.

498
00:33:12.000 --> 00:33:12.880
F***.

499
00:33:38.840 --> 00:33:41.200
Where did this kid run off to again?

500
00:33:49.180 --> 00:33:51.019
(Sports: Nunchaku Training)

501
00:33:51.020 --> 00:33:52.520
Nunchaku?

502
00:34:51.840 --> 00:34:53.089
Because it was hastily made,

503
00:34:53.090 --> 00:34:54.470
it's not very smooth to practice with.

504
00:35:06.050 --> 00:35:07.280
Teacher, are you okay?

505
00:35:11.460 --> 00:35:12.520
Are you hurt anywhere?

506
00:35:20.560 --> 00:35:22.370
Don't you know about that incident?

507
00:35:22.740 --> 00:35:24.079
Then of course I can't just let you go.

508
00:35:24.080 --> 00:35:25.410
What are you talking about, trash?

509
00:35:26.550 --> 00:35:29.559
Geon-yeop, please stop hitting him.

510
00:35:30.311 --> 00:35:31.609
Think back carefully.

511
00:35:31.610 --> 00:35:32.939
Since you're also Pi Han-wool's lackey,

512
00:35:32.940 --> 00:35:34.289
you must have heard something, right?

513
00:35:34.290 --> 00:35:35.339
I don't know, f***!

514
00:35:35.340 --> 00:35:37.479
You guys used this to pry open the teacher's door, right?

515
00:35:37.480 --> 00:35:39.459
I'd also like to try using it to pry your mouth open.

516
00:35:39.460 --> 00:35:40.839
Hey, hurry up and stop this guy.

517
00:35:40.840 --> 00:35:42.000
Careful with your teeth.

518
00:35:45.960 --> 00:35:47.719
- That's enough. - Let go.

519
00:35:47.720 --> 00:35:50.530
While I don't know why you're so angry,
doing this is going too far.

520
00:35:51.000 --> 00:35:52.310
You want me to stop?

521
00:35:52.690 --> 00:35:55.310
My mom died, how can I stop?

522
00:35:57.800 --> 00:35:59.209
So don't get in my way. Get lost.

523
00:35:59.210 --> 00:36:00.799
Don't let go, f***.

524
00:36:00.800 --> 00:36:02.220
- Let go. - Don't let go.

525
00:36:37.310 --> 00:36:38.300
Teacher.

526
00:36:39.540 --> 00:36:42.140
Handle the student who ran away however you see fit.

527
00:36:43.420 --> 00:36:45.149
Any appropriate punishment,

528
00:36:45.150 --> 00:36:46.960
don't believe too much in things like that.

529
00:36:48.520 --> 00:36:50.930
I'm only telling you this because you're like a mother to me.

530
00:37:00.700 --> 00:37:02.450
You invited me to join the study group, right?

531
00:37:03.170 --> 00:37:03.960
What?

532
00:37:04.970 --> 00:37:05.650
Yes.

533
00:37:05.651 --> 00:37:06.940
Wake up.

534
00:37:07.560 --> 00:37:08.840
This is Meteor Vocational High School.

535
00:37:24.200 --> 00:37:25.500
Jiamin.

536
00:37:27.310 --> 00:37:28.190
For you.

537
00:37:32.270 --> 00:37:33.200
Teacher.

538
00:37:33.660 --> 00:37:35.479
Are you really okay?

539
00:37:35.480 --> 00:37:36.240
Yeah.

540
00:37:37.260 --> 00:37:40.010
Stop worrying about me. Hurry home and study.

541
00:37:40.640 --> 00:37:41.650
Also,

542
00:37:43.280 --> 00:37:45.110
you know there's still plenty of time, right?

543
00:37:51.750 --> 00:37:55.660
(For you who wants to become stronger
Bruce Lee, You will become what you want to be)

544
00:38:51.700 --> 00:38:52.780
Teacher.

545
00:38:53.720 --> 00:38:55.290
I'm Hoon-jae.

546
00:38:55.950 --> 00:38:57.609
Please open the door.

547
00:38:57.610 --> 00:38:59.290
I have something to say.

548
00:39:13.970 --> 00:39:15.229
Teacher.

549
00:39:15.230 --> 00:39:16.960
Can you let me off the hook?

550
00:39:18.080 --> 00:39:20.000
I'm really sorry.

551
00:39:21.110 --> 00:39:22.789
This incident was ordered by Han-wool bro.

552
00:39:22.790 --> 00:39:24.920
If I didn't follow orders, I'd really die.

553
00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:28.780
I'm truly sorry. Please let me go.

554
00:39:29.660 --> 00:39:30.850
Please.

555
00:39:31.560 --> 00:39:32.590
I'm sorry.

556
00:39:40.500 --> 00:39:41.560
Okay.

557
00:39:43.700 --> 00:39:46.080
But I have something to ask you.

558
00:39:50.470 --> 00:39:52.570
(Find 5 study group members in 2 weeks)
(1 Yoon Jiamin, 2 Kim Se-hyun)

559
00:39:54.240 --> 00:39:56.350
There are really only a few days left.

560
00:40:15.010 --> 00:40:16.449
Don't give up.

561
00:40:16.450 --> 00:40:17.380
I can do it.

562
00:40:18.150 --> 00:40:19.180
Scared me.

563
00:40:25.870 --> 00:40:26.980
What should we do?

564
00:40:39.500 --> 00:40:40.629
It's here, right?

565
00:40:40.630 --> 00:40:41.210
Right.

566
00:40:41.211 --> 00:40:42.439
Seriously.

567
00:40:42.440 --> 00:40:43.380
I told you it is.

568
00:40:50.200 --> 00:40:51.539
How about you go?

569
00:40:51.540 --> 00:40:53.009
Of course you have to go.

570
00:40:53.010 --> 00:40:54.459
No need, you can go too.

571
00:40:54.460 --> 00:40:57.229
No need, hurry up before she changes her mind.

572
00:40:57.230 --> 00:40:58.170
True.

573
00:40:58.171 --> 00:40:59.600
Before she changes her mind.

574
00:41:01.650 --> 00:41:03.379
But what was her name again?

575
00:41:03.380 --> 00:41:05.300
Ji-woo. Lee Ji-woo.

576
00:41:11.070 --> 00:41:13.440
By the way, didn't I mention it?

577
00:41:14.630 --> 00:41:15.940
Our Meteor Vocational High School is...

578
00:41:19.070 --> 00:41:20.340
Co-ed.

579
00:41:24.630 --> 00:41:28.670
"Study Group"

